id: CTB-SRC0029-environments
source: SRC-0029
section: §0.2
kind: requirement
scope: ARC
title: Open-ended environments by configuration
applied-in: STG-00.A-1
distinct-from: LXM-REQ-000043, LXM-REQ-000196, LXM-REQ-000198
text: Environments are open-ended registered configuration: any number of environments, each registered with its identity, purpose, configuration overlay, secret references, data isolation, providers, release gates and promotion path, and a new environment is added by registration alone. No code names an environment or branches on an environment name; behaviour that differs between environments is a declared setting that each environment sets.
